{%- comment -%}
  Casify product page: "The Shop Counter" (templates/product.convert.json).
  The familiar two-column product page set out as a candy counter: the real
  photos on a marble stage with a rail of candy-shop photo tickets; on the
  right a vendor ticket, the title, the rating row, a hanging brass price tag,
  style swatches, the model dropdown, candy-box pack tiers, the savings meter,
  Add to bag beside Buy now, the ship-by line, the service ribbon and two
  accordions.

  Commerce is shared with the Order Slip in assets/cv-product.js: the options
  resolve a real variant id, pack tiers set the quantity, and every pack price
  applies the tier's percentage the way the store's automatic discounts do
  ("Pack of 2 cases: 18% off", "Pack of 3 cases: 31% off"), so the page price
  is the checkout price. Buy now adds the same line and goes to checkout.

  Product ratings come only from Shopify's standard review metafields
  (reviews.rating, reviews.rating_count), which review apps write. Until they
  exist the row reads "No reviews yet". The separate Trustpilot and Google
  strip is a merchant-supplied store rating and never feeds product review data.

  The offer tag uses the selected variant's compare-at price when one exists.
  Otherwise it may use the merchant-supplied fallback from this section. The
  percentage and amount saved are always calculated from the displayed prices.

  Low stock line reads the chosen variant's real inventory_quantity; it only
  shows for a variant Shopify tracks and stops selling at zero, under the
  merchant's own threshold, so it is never a fabricated urgency cue.

  Styles: assets/cv-pdp-counter.css. Zoom, ship-by date: assets/cv-pdp-counter.js.
  Motion: assets/cv-pdp-counter-motion.js.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'cv-pdp-counter.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'cv-pdp-extras.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<script>
  /* Hide the tag, photo tickets and meter until cv-pdp-counter-motion.js has set their start
     states. Never under reduced motion, and never for long. */
  (function (root) {
    if (window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) return;
    root.classList.add('cvc-pending');
    setTimeout(function () { root.classList.remove('cvc-pending'); }, 1400);
  })(document.documentElement);
</script>

{%- liquid
  assign cvar = product.selected_or_first_available_variant

  comment
    The phone-model option: named like one, or else the first option whose values name phones.
  endcomment
  assign model_oi = -1
  for option in product.options_with_values
    assign oname = option.name | downcase
    if oname contains 'model' or oname contains 'phone' or oname contains 'device' or oname contains 'compatib'
      assign model_oi = forloop.index0
      break
    endif
  endfor
  if model_oi == -1
    for option in product.options_with_values
      assign fv = option.values.first | downcase
      if fv contains 'iphone' or fv contains 'galaxy' or fv contains 'pixel' or fv contains 'samsung'
        assign model_oi = forloop.index0
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  assign tier_count = 0
  assign active_tier = nil
  assign max_pct = 0
  for b in section.blocks
    if b.type == 'tier'
      assign tier_count = tier_count | plus: 1
      if b.settings.discount_pct > max_pct
        assign max_pct = b.settings.discount_pct
      endif
      if active_tier == nil and b.settings.default_checked
        assign active_tier = b
      endif
    endif
  endfor
  if tier_count > 0 and active_tier == nil
    for b in section.blocks
      if b.type == 'tier'
        assign active_tier = b
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif

  assign active_qty = 1
  assign active_pct = 0
  if active_tier != nil
    assign active_qty = active_tier.settings.qty | at_least: 1
    assign active_pct = active_tier.settings.discount_pct
  endif

  comment
    Shopify takes a percentage discount off the line and rounds to the cent, so the page does too.
  endcomment
  assign active_line = cvar.price | times: active_qty
  assign active_off = active_line | times: active_pct | divided_by: 100.0 | round
  assign active_total = active_line | minus: active_off

  assign compare_fallback = section.settings.compare_price_fallback | default: '0' | times: 100 | round
  assign compare_price = cvar.compare_at_price | default: 0
  if compare_price <= cvar.price and compare_fallback > cvar.price
    assign compare_price = compare_fallback
  endif
  assign show_compare = false
  assign compare_savings = 0
  assign compare_discount = 0
  if compare_price > cvar.price
    assign show_compare = true
    assign compare_savings = compare_price | minus: cvar.price
    assign compare_discount = compare_savings | times: 100.0 | divided_by: compare_price | round
  endif

  assign next_tier = nil
  for b in section.blocks
    if b.type == 'tier' and b.settings.discount_pct > active_pct
      if next_tier == nil
        assign next_tier = b
      elsif b.settings.discount_pct < next_tier.settings.discount_pct
        assign next_tier = b
      endif
    endif
  endfor

  assign meter_pct = 0
  if max_pct > 0
    assign meter_pct = active_pct | times: 100.0 | divided_by: max_pct | round
  endif

  assign rating = product.metafields.reviews.rating.value
  assign rating_count = product.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value | default: 0
  assign star_pct = 100
  assign has_rating = false
  if rating != blank and rating_count > 0
    assign has_rating = true
    assign r_max = rating.scale_max | default: 5
    assign star_pct = rating.rating | times: 100.0 | divided_by: r_max | round: 1
  endif

  comment
    Low stock: only for a variant Shopify itself is tracking, only while it's
    actually in stock, and only under the merchant's own threshold. Never
    shown for untracked inventory or "continue selling" variants, where a
    count would not be a real number.
  endcomment
  assign show_stock = false
  assign stock_qty = 0
  if section.settings.low_stock_threshold > 0 and cvar.inventory_management == 'shopify' and cvar.inventory_policy == 'deny' and cvar.inventory_quantity > 0 and cvar.inventory_quantity <= section.settings.low_stock_threshold
    assign show_stock = true
    assign stock_qty = cvar.inventory_quantity
  endif
  assign stock_text = section.settings.low_stock_text | replace: '[qty]', stock_qty

  comment
    Breadcrumb: the collection the shopper came from, else the product's first real
    category; never the store's front-page collection ("Home page").
  endcomment
  assign crumb_collection = false
  if collection != blank and collection.handle != 'frontpage'
    assign crumb_collection = collection
  else
    for c in product.collections
      if c.handle != 'frontpage'
        assign crumb_collection = c
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  assign hero_media = cvar.featured_media | default: product.featured_media
  assign hero_image = hero_media.preview_image | default: hero_media
  assign gallery_count = product.media.size | at_most: 8
-%}

<section class="cvc" id="cvPdp" data-cv-pdp="counter"
         data-variants="{{ product.variants | json | escape }}"
         data-current-options="{{ cvar.options | json | escape }}"
         data-money-format="{{ shop.money_format | escape }}"
         data-model-index="{{ model_oi }}"
         data-max-pct="{{ max_pct }}"
         data-compare-at-fallback="{{ compare_fallback }}"
         style="--cvc-box: url('{{ 'pdp-counter-box.webp' | asset_url }}'); --cvc-box-teal: url('{{ 'pdp-counter-box-teal.webp' | asset_url }}');">
  <div class="cvc__inner">
    <nav class="cvc__crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      {%- if crumb_collection != blank -%}
        <a href="{{ crumb_collection.url }}">{{ crumb_collection.title | escape }}</a>
      {%- else -%}
        <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{{ section.settings.crumb_label | default: 'Cases' | escape }}</a>
      {%- endif -%}
      <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">{{ product.title | escape }}</span>
    </nav>

    <div class="cvc__grid">
      {%- comment -%} ================= Photos: candy-shop ticket rail + marble stage ================= {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="cvc__gallery{% if product.media.size <= 1 %} cvc__gallery--single{% endif %}">
        {%- if product.media.size > 1 -%}
          <div class="cvc__photo-reel-shell">
            <span class="cvc__photo-reel-track cvc__photo-reel-track--vertical" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 320" preserveAspectRatio="none" focusable="false">
                <path class="cvc__photo-reel-shadow" d="M12 7V313"/>
                <path class="cvc__photo-reel-cream" d="M12 7V313"/>
                <path class="cvc__photo-reel-stripe" data-cvc-reel-path d="M12 7V313"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <span class="cvc__photo-reel-track cvc__photo-reel-track--horizontal" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 320 24" preserveAspectRatio="none" focusable="false">
                <path class="cvc__photo-reel-shadow" d="M7 12H313"/>
                <path class="cvc__photo-reel-cream" d="M7 12H313"/>
                <path class="cvc__photo-reel-stripe" data-cvc-reel-path d="M7 12H313"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <img
              class="cvc__photo-reel-sweet cvc__photo-reel-sweet--start"
              src="{{ 'hero-sweet-wrapped-red.webp' | asset_url }}"
              width="440"
              height="212"
              alt=""
              loading="eager"
              decoding="async"
            >
            {%- assign hero_thumb_index = 1 -%}
            <div class="cvc__photo-reel" role="tablist" aria-label="{{ 'products.gallery.photos' | t }}">
              {%- for media in product.media limit: 8 -%}
                {%- if media.media_type == 'image' or media.preview_image -%}
                  {%- assign pic = media.preview_image | default: media -%}
                  {%- if media.id == hero_media.id -%}{%- assign hero_thumb_index = forloop.index -%}{%- endif -%}
                  <button type="button" class="cvc__photo-ticket" id="cvcThumb-{{ section.id }}-{{ forloop.index }}" role="tab" data-cv-thumb
                          aria-selected="{% if media.id == hero_media.id %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                          aria-controls="cvcMedia-{{ section.id }}"
                          tabindex="{% if media.id == hero_media.id %}0{% else %}-1{% endif %}"
                          aria-label="{{ 'products.gallery.photo_count' | t: index: forloop.index, count: gallery_count }}"
                          data-cv-full="{{ pic | image_url: width: 1400 }}"
                          data-cv-zoom="{{ pic | image_url: width: 2400 }}">
                    <span class="cvc__photo-ticket-card">
                      <svg class="cvc__photo-ticket-frame" viewBox="0 0 96 108" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                        <path class="cvc__photo-ticket-paper" d="M13 3H83C83 8 87 12 93 12V96C87 96 83 100 83 105H13C13 100 9 96 3 96V12C9 12 13 8 13 3Z"/>
                        <path class="cvc__photo-ticket-outline" d="M13 3H83C83 8 87 12 93 12V96C87 96 83 100 83 105H13C13 100 9 96 3 96V12C9 12 13 8 13 3Z"/>
                        <path class="cvc__photo-ticket-perf" d="M13 86H83"/>
                      </svg>
                      <span class="cvc__photo-ticket-image">{{ pic | image_url: width: 240 | image_tag: width: 160, height: 160, alt: '', loading: 'lazy' }}</span>
                      <span class="cvc__photo-ticket-no" aria-hidden="true">{{ forloop.index }}</span>
                    </span>
                  </button>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
            <img
              class="cvc__photo-reel-sweet cvc__photo-reel-sweet--end"
              src="{{ 'hero-sweet-wrapped-teal.webp' | asset_url }}"
              width="440"
              height="164"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            >
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="cvc__stage cvc__stage--awning-{{ section.settings.show_awning }}"{% if product.media.size > 1 %} id="cvcMedia-{{ section.id }}" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="cvcThumb-{{ section.id }}-{{ hero_thumb_index }}"{% endif %}>
          {%- render 'cv-awning', show: section.settings.show_awning, stripes: section.settings.awning_stripes, tone: section.settings.awning_tone, swipe: section.settings.awning_swipe -%}
          {%- render 'cv-photo-price', show: section.settings.show_photo_price, variant: cvar -%}
          {%- if hero_media != blank -%}
            {{ hero_image | image_url: width: 1400 | image_tag:
                widths: '600, 900, 1200, 1400',
                sizes: '(min-width: 1270px) 520px, (min-width: 990px) 44vw, calc(100vw - 32px)',
                class: 'cvc__photo', id: 'cvMainImage',
                alt: hero_media.alt | default: product.title,
                loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high' }}
            <button type="button" class="cvc__zoom" data-cvc-zoom-open aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="cvcZoom-{{ section.id }}"
                    data-cv-zoom="{{ hero_image | image_url: width: 2400 }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="M15.4 15.4 21 21"/></svg>
              <span>{{ section.settings.zoom_label | default: 'Tap to zoom' | escape }}</span>
            </button>
          {%- else -%}
            <span class="cvc__photo cvc__photo--empty" id="cvMainImage" role="img" aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}"></span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} ================= The counter: buy box ================= {%- endcomment -%}
      <form class="cvc__box" id="cvAddForm" method="post" action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="id" id="cvVariantId" value="{{ cvar.id }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="quantity" id="cvQuantity" value="{{ active_qty }}">

        {%- if product.vendor != blank -%}
          <p class="cvc__vendor">{{ product.vendor | escape }}{% if section.settings.vendor_suffix != blank %} {{ section.settings.vendor_suffix | escape }}{% endif %}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          The brass price tag by the title ("Hanging price tag by the title").
          Off, the price still shows in the summary under the title; the
          scripts that update the tag skip it when it isn't there.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if section.settings.show_price_tag -%}
        <p class="cvc__tag">
          <img class="cvc__tag-plate" src="{{ 'pdp-counter-tag.webp' | asset_url }}" width="360" height="414" alt="" loading="eager">
          <span class="cvc__tag-price" aria-live="polite">
            <span id="cvPriceNow"><span class="cvc__visually-hidden">{{ 'products.price_offer.now' | t }}: </span>{{ cvar.price | money }}</span>
            <s id="cvPriceWas"{% unless show_compare %} hidden{% endunless %}><span class="cvc__visually-hidden">{{ 'products.price_offer.compare_at' | t }}: </span>{{ compare_price | money }}</s>
          </span>
          <span class="cvc__tag-sale" data-cv-tag-sale{% unless show_compare %} hidden{% endunless %} aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" focusable="false">
              <path d="M50 3 59 12 72 8 77 21 91 23 88 37 98 47 89 58 93 72 79 77 76 91 62 88 51 98 41 89 27 93 22 79 8 76 12 62 2 51 11 41 7 27 21 22 24 8 38 12Z"/>
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="34"/>
            </svg>
            <span class="cvc__tag-sale-copy"><strong data-cv-discount-pct>{{ compare_discount }}%</strong><small>{{ 'products.price_offer.off' | t }}</small></span>
          </span>
        </p>
        {%- endif -%}

        <h1 class="cvc__title">{{ product.title | escape }}</h1>

        {%- render 'cv-counter-blocks', blocks: section.blocks, type: 'summary', product: product, variant: cvar, settings: section.settings -%}

        <p class="cvc__price-saving cvc__price-saving--{{ section.settings.show_price_saving }}" data-cv-price-proof aria-live="polite"{% unless show_compare %} hidden{% endunless %}>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13 13 20 4 11V4h7l9 9Z"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.25"/></svg>
          <span>{{ 'products.price_offer.you_save' | t }}</span>
          <strong data-cv-price-save>{{ compare_savings | money }}</strong>
        </p>

        {%- assign service_count = 0 -%}
        {%- for b in section.blocks -%}{%- if b.type == 'service' -%}{%- assign service_count = service_count | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
        {%- if service_count > 0 -%}
          <ul class="cvc__ribbon" role="list" data-cvc-benefits>
            {%- for b in section.blocks -%}
              {%- if b.type == 'service' -%}
                <li class="cvc__ribbon-item" data-cvc-benefit {{ b.shopify_attributes }}>
                  {%- case b.settings.icon -%}
                    {%- when 'returns' -%}
                      <svg data-cvc-benefit-icon viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 11a8 8 0 0 1 14-5"/><path d="M18 3v3.5h-3.5"/><path d="M20 13a8 8 0 0 1-14 5"/><path d="M6 21v-3.5h3.5"/></svg>
                    {%- when 'box' -%}
                      <svg data-cvc-benefit-icon viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2.8 20 7v10l-8 4.2L4 17V7z"/><path d="m4 7 8 4.2L20 7"/><path d="M12 11.2v10"/><path d="m8 4.9 8 4.2"/></svg>
                    {%- else -%}
                      <svg data-cvc-benefit-icon viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2.5 6.5h10.5v9H2.5z"/><path d="M13 9.5h4.2l3.3 3.4v2.6H13z"/><circle cx="6.5" cy="17.5" r="1.9"/><circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="1.9"/></svg>
                  {%- endcase -%}
                  <span>{{ b.settings.text | escape }}</span>
                </li>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if section.settings.show_rating -%}
          <a class="cvc__rating" href="#{{ section.settings.reviews_anchor | default: 'cvc-reviews' | remove: '#' | escape }}" data-cvc-rating>
            {%- render 'cv-stars', fill: star_pct, class: 'cvc__stars' -%}
            {%- if has_rating -%}
              <span class="cvc__rating-text" data-cvc-rating-text>{{ rating.rating | round: 1 }} <span class="cvc__visually-hidden">out of {{ rating.scale_max | default: 5 }} stars,</span><span class="cvc__rating-separator" aria-hidden="true">·</span><u>{{ rating_count }} {% if rating_count == 1 %}review{% else %}reviews{% endif %}</u></span>
            {%- else -%}
              <span class="cvc__rating-text" data-cvc-rating-text>{{ section.settings.empty_rating_text | default: '+1000 Happy Customer' | escape }}<span class="cvc__rating-separator" aria-hidden="true">·</span><u>{{ section.settings.empty_rating_link | default: 'Write the first' | escape }}</u></span>
            {%- endif -%}
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%}
          Google and Trustpilot tickets sit under the price, inside the "Rating, price &
          pitch" block. Without that block they show here instead.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- assign has_summary = false -%}
        {%- for b in section.blocks -%}{%- if b.type == 'summary' -%}{%- assign has_summary = true -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
        {%- unless has_summary -%}
          {%- render 'cv-store-ratings', settings: section.settings -%}
        {%- endunless -%}

        <p class="cvc__stock cvc__stock--{{ section.settings.stock_style | default: 'pill' }}" data-cvc-stock role="status" aria-atomic="true"
           data-threshold="{{ section.settings.low_stock_threshold }}"
           data-template="{{ section.settings.low_stock_text | escape }}"
           {% unless show_stock %}hidden{% endunless %}>
          <span class="cvc__stock-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-cvc-stock-text>{{ stock_text }}</span>
        </p>

        {%- render 'cv-counter-blocks', blocks: section.blocks, type: 'sales_note', product: product -%}

        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.type == '@app' -%}<div class="cvc__app">{% render block %}</div>{%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}

        {%- comment -%} ---------- The non-model options: swatches when every value has its own photo ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- for option in product.options_with_values -%}
          {%- assign oi = forloop.index0 -%}
          {%- if oi != model_oi and option.values.size > 0 -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign line_label = option.name
              if section.settings.option_label != blank
                assign line_label = section.settings.option_label
              endif
              assign swatch_photos = true
              for value in option.values
                assign found = false
                for v in product.variants
                  if v.options[oi] == value and v.featured_image
                    assign found = true
                    break
                  endif
                endfor
                unless found
                  assign swatch_photos = false
                  break
                endunless
              endfor
            -%}
            <div class="cvc__opt">
              <p class="cvc__label" id="cvcOpt{{ oi }}-{{ section.id }}">{{ line_label | escape }}: <span class="cvc__label-value" data-cv-opt-out="{{ oi }}">{{ cvar.options[oi] | escape }}</span></p>
              <div class="cvc__swatches{% unless swatch_photos %} cvc__swatches--text{% endunless %}" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="cvcOpt{{ oi }}-{{ section.id }}">
                {%- for value in option.values -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign vmatch = nil
                    assign vpic = nil
                    for v in product.variants
                      if v.options[oi] == value
                        if vmatch == nil
                          assign vmatch = v
                        endif
                        if vpic == nil and v.featured_image
                          assign vpic = v.featured_image
                        endif
                        if v.available
                          assign vmatch = v
                          if vpic != nil
                            break
                          endif
                        endif
                      endif
                    endfor
                  -%}
                  <button type="button" class="cvc__swatch" role="radio"
                          aria-checked="{% if cvar.options[oi] == value %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                          tabindex="{% if cvar.options[oi] == value %}0{% else %}-1{% endif %}"
                          {% if swatch_photos %}aria-label="{{ value | escape }}" title="{{ value | escape }}"{% endif %}
                          data-cv-option-index="{{ oi }}"
                          data-cv-value="{{ value | escape }}"
                          data-cv-stock="{% unless vmatch.available %}out{% endunless %}">
                    {%- if swatch_photos -%}
                      {{ vpic | image_url: width: 140 | image_tag: width: 70, height: 70, alt: '', loading: 'lazy' }}
                    {%- else -%}
                      {{ value | escape }}
                    {%- endif -%}
                  </button>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}

        {%- comment -%} ---------- The phone model: a native dropdown, every value this case is made for ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if model_oi >= 0 -%}
          {%- assign model_option = product.options_with_values[model_oi] -%}
          <div class="cvc__opt cvc__opt--model">
            <label class="cvc__label" for="cvcModel-{{ section.id }}">{{ section.settings.model_label | default: 'Model' | escape }}</label>
            <span class="cvc__select">
              <select id="cvcModel-{{ section.id }}" name="options[{{ model_option.name | escape }}]" data-cv-option-index="{{ model_oi }}" data-sold-suffix=" (sold out)">
                {%- for value in model_option.values -%}
                  {%- liquid
                    assign vmatch = nil
                    for v in product.variants
                      if v.options[model_oi] == value
                        if vmatch == nil
                          assign vmatch = v
                        endif
                        if v.available
                          assign vmatch = v
                          break
                        endif
                      endif
                    endfor
                  -%}
                  <option value="{{ value | escape }}"{% if cvar.options[model_oi] == value %} selected{% endif %}>{{ value | escape }}{% unless vmatch.available %} (sold out){% endunless %}</option>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </select>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg>
            </span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%} ---------- Candy-box packs + savings meter ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if tier_count > 0 -%}
          <div class="cvc__packs" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{ section.settings.packs_label | default: 'How many cases' | escape }}">
            {%- for b in section.blocks -%}
              {%- if b.type == 'tier' -%}
                {%- liquid
                  assign t_qty = b.settings.qty | at_least: 1
                  assign t_line = cvar.price | times: t_qty
                  assign t_off = t_line | times: b.settings.discount_pct | divided_by: 100.0 | round
                  assign t_each = t_line | minus: t_off | divided_by: t_qty
                -%}
                <button type="button" class="cvc__pack{% if b.settings.accent == 'teal' %} cvc__pack--teal{% endif %}" role="radio" data-cv-pack
                        aria-checked="{% if b.id == active_tier.id %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
                        tabindex="{% if b.id == active_tier.id %}0{% else %}-1{% endif %}"
                        data-cv-qty="{{ t_qty }}"
                        data-cv-discount="{{ b.settings.discount_pct }}"
                        {{ b.shopify_attributes }}>
                  {%- if b.settings.flag_label != blank -%}<span class="cvc__flag">{{ b.settings.flag_label | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                  <span class="cvc__pack-name">{{ b.settings.name | escape }}</span>
                  <span class="cvc__pack-each" data-cv-tier-each="small">{{ t_each | money }}{% if t_qty > 1 %}<small> each</small>{% endif %}</span>
                  <s class="cvc__pack-was" data-cv-tier-was{% unless show_compare %} hidden{% endunless %}><span class="cvc__visually-hidden">{{ 'products.price_offer.compare_at' | t }}: </span><span data-cv-tier-was-value>{{ compare_price | money }}</span></s>
                </button>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>

          {%- if max_pct > 0 -%}
            {%- liquid
              if active_off > 0
                assign active_off_money = active_off | money
                assign savings_line = section.settings.savings_text | default: '[qty] cases saves you [amount] vs buying singly' | replace: '[qty]', active_qty | replace: '[amount]', active_off_money
              elsif next_tier != nil
                assign savings_line = section.settings.savings_next_text | default: 'Choose [qty] cases to save [pct]% on each' | replace: '[qty]', next_tier.settings.qty | replace: '[pct]', next_tier.settings.discount_pct
              endif
            -%}
            <div class="cvc__savings">
              <span class="cvc__meter" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cvc__meter-fill" data-cv-savings-fill style="width: {{ meter_pct }}%;"></span></span>
              <p class="cvc__savings-text" data-cv-savings aria-live="polite"
                 data-template-save="{{ section.settings.savings_text | default: '[qty] cases saves you [amount] vs buying singly' | escape }}"
                 data-template-next="{{ section.settings.savings_next_text | default: 'Choose [qty] cases to save [pct]% on each' | escape }}">{{ savings_line | escape }}</p>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}

          {%- comment -%} ---------- Mix-and-match: each case in a pack gets its own colour and phone ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if section.settings.mix_packs -%}
            {%- assign max_qty = 1 -%}
            {%- for b in section.blocks -%}{%- if b.type == 'tier' and b.settings.qty > max_qty -%}{%- assign max_qty = b.settings.qty -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
            {%- render 'cv-pack-slots', product: product, model_oi: model_oi, max_qty: max_qty, active_qty: active_qty, look: 'counter', sid: section.id,
                heading: section.settings.mix_heading, hint: section.settings.mix_hint, same_label: section.settings.mix_same, first_note: section.settings.mix_first_note -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- comment -%} ---------- Add to bag + Buy now ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="cvc__buttons">
          <button type="submit" class="cvc__add" id="cvAddBtn"{% unless cvar.available %} disabled{% endunless %}>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14l-1 12H6z"/><path d="M9 8V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v2"/></svg>
            <span id="cvCtaLabel" data-label-default="{{ section.settings.cta_label | default: 'Add to bag' | escape }}">
              {%- if cvar.available -%}{{ section.settings.cta_label | default: 'Add to bag' | escape }}{%- else -%}Sold out{%- endif -%}
            </span>
            <span class="cvc__add-total"><span aria-hidden="true">·</span> <span id="cvTotal">{{ active_total | money }}</span></span>
          </button>
          {%- if section.settings.show_buy_now -%}
            <button type="button" class="cvc__buy" data-cv-buy-now{% unless cvar.available %} disabled{% endunless %}>
              <span data-cv-buy-label data-label-default="{{ section.settings.buy_label | default: 'Buy now' | escape }}">{{ section.settings.buy_label | default: 'Buy now' | escape }}</span>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15"/><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
            </button>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <p class="cvc__status" id="cvStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

        {%- render 'cv-counter-blocks', blocks: section.blocks, type: 'google_rating', product: product -%}

        {%- if section.settings.dispatch_max > 0 -%}
          <p class="cvc__shipby" data-cvc-ship-by data-max-days="{{ section.settings.dispatch_max }}"
             data-template="{{ section.settings.ship_by_text | default: 'Order today, ships by [date]' | escape }}">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.6"/><path d="M12 7.3V12l3 1.9"/></svg>
            <span data-cvc-ship-by-text>{{ section.settings.ship_by_fallback | default: 'Ships in 1-3 business days' | escape }}</span>
          </p>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- render 'cv-product-accordions',
          product: product,
          model_oi: model_oi,
          details_label: section.settings.details_label,
          brand_label: section.settings.brand_label,
          shipping_label: section.settings.shipping_label,
          shipping_text: section.settings.shipping_text
        -%}
      </form>

      {%- comment -%}
        Video reviews (snippets/cv-video-reviews.liquid): this section's "Video
        review" blocks, with text from its optional "Video reviews: text" block.
        A third grid item: on desktop it sits in the photo column under the
        photo (assets/cv-pdp-video-reviews.css), in one column it follows the
        buy box. Renders nothing until this product has a clip.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign vr_block = nil
        for b in section.blocks
          if b.type == 'video_reviews'
            assign vr_block = b
            break
          endif
        endfor
        assign vr_uid = section.id | append: '-vr'
      -%}
      {%- render 'cv-video-reviews', blocks: section.blocks, clip_type: 'video_review', settings: vr_block.settings, uid: vr_uid, mode: 'inline', attrs: vr_block.shopify_attributes, product: product -%}
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} Zoom: the real photos, large, panned by pointer or finger. {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if hero_image != blank -%}
    <dialog class="cvc-zoom" id="cvcZoom-{{ section.id }}" aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}: photos" data-cvc-zoom>
      <div class="cvc-zoom__frame" data-cvc-zoom-frame>
        <img
          class="cvc-zoom__img"
          src="{{ hero_image | image_url: width: 2400 }}"
          alt="{{ hero_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
          width="{{ hero_image.width }}"
          height="{{ hero_image.height }}"
          loading="lazy"
          data-cvc-zoom-img
        >
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="cvc-zoom__btn cvc-zoom__btn--close" data-cvc-zoom-close aria-label="Close">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18"/></svg>
      </button>
      {%- if product.media.size > 1 -%}
        <button type="button" class="cvc-zoom__btn cvc-zoom__btn--prev" data-cvc-zoom-step="-1" aria-label="Previous photo">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 5-7 7 7 7"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="cvc-zoom__btn cvc-zoom__btn--next" data-cvc-zoom-step="1" aria-label="Next photo">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </button>
      {%- endif -%}
      <p class="cvc-zoom__count" data-cvc-zoom-count aria-live="polite"></p>
    </dialog>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} Sticky bar once the Add to bag button scrolls away: both buttons stay in reach. {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="cvc-sticky" id="cvSticky" aria-hidden="true">
    {%- if hero_media != blank -%}
      <span class="cvc-sticky__pic">{{ hero_image | image_url: width: 120 | image_tag: width: 48, height: 48, alt: '', loading: 'lazy' }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div class="cvc-sticky__info">
      <span class="cvc-sticky__name">{{ product.title | escape }}</span>
      <span class="cvc-sticky__meta"><span data-cv-opt-out-sticky>{{ cvar.title | escape }}</span> · <b id="cvStickyTotal">{{ active_total | money }}</b></span>
    </div>
    <div class="cvc-sticky__buttons">
      <button type="button" class="cvc-sticky__add" id="cvStickyBtn" tabindex="-1">{{ section.settings.sticky_cta | default: 'Add to bag' | escape }}</button>
      {%- if section.settings.show_buy_now -%}
        <button type="button" class="cvc-sticky__buy" data-cv-buy-now tabindex="-1">{{ section.settings.buy_label | default: 'Buy now' | escape }}</button>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- render 'cv-product-schema', product: product, has_rating: has_rating, rating: rating, rating_count: rating_count -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Product: shop counter",
  "tag": "div",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "crumb_label", "label": "Breadcrumb shop label", "default": "Cases", "info": "Used when the product isn't viewed inside a collection." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "vendor_suffix", "label": "Vendor ticket suffix", "default": "Cases", "info": "Shown after the vendor name, for example Casify Cases." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "zoom_label", "label": "Zoom chip", "default": "Tap to zoom" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Price offer" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "compare_price_fallback", "label": "Fallback compare-at price", "default": "59.99", "info": "Used only when the selected variant has no higher compare-at price." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Rating" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_price_saving", "label": "Show the \"You save\" line", "default": true, "info": "Under the title, when the variant has a real compare-at price. Turn off if the \"Rating, price & pitch\" block already shows the saving." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_rating", "label": "Show rating row", "default": true, "info": "Reads Shopify's review metafields, which review apps such as Judge.me write. Turn off if your app adds its own star block here." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "reviews_anchor", "label": "Reviews section anchor", "default": "cvc-reviews" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Main image awning" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_awning", "label": "Hang a shop awning over the main photo", "default": false, "info": "A 3D fabric canopy that unrolls on load and sways in the breeze. Flat for shoppers who prefer reduced motion." },
    { "type": "range", "id": "awning_stripes", "label": "Stripes", "min": 8, "max": 24, "step": 2, "default": 16 },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "awning_tone",
      "label": "Awning colour",
      "options": [
        { "value": "red", "label": "Candy red and cream" },
        { "value": "teal", "label": "Teal and cream" }
      ],
      "default": "red",
      "info": "The colour it starts in."
    },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_price_tag", "label": "Hanging price tag by the title", "default": true, "info": "The brass tag with the price and a red \"% off\" burst. Off, the price still shows under the title." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_photo_price", "label": "Price tag on the photo", "default": false, "info": "A 3D price tag hangs from the awning and flips when the variant changes. Shows a struck-through price and saving only when the variant has a real compare-at price." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "awning_swipe", "label": "Let shoppers swipe to switch red and teal", "default": true, "info": "A sideways scroll, swipe or drag over the awning slides it to the other colour." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "empty_rating_text", "label": "Customer proof text", "default": "+1000 Happy Customer", "info": "Shown before this product has its own reviews." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "empty_rating_link", "label": "No reviews link", "default": "Write the first" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Google and Trustpilot ratings" },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Shown under the price, one ticket per platform. A ticket shows only when its rating is filled in. Copy the numbers from your Google Business Profile and Trustpilot page, and update them when they change." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_external_review_badges", "label": "Show Google and Trustpilot ratings", "default": true },
    { "type": "text", "id": "external_review_rating", "label": "Google rating", "info": "For example 4.8. Also used for the stars under the title while a product has no reviews of its own." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "external_review_count", "label": "Google review count", "info": "For example 1,000+." },
    { "type": "url", "id": "google_reviews_url", "label": "Google reviews link", "info": "Optional. Opens your Google reviews in a new tab." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "trustpilot_rating", "label": "Trustpilot rating", "info": "Your TrustScore, for example 4.5." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "trustpilot_review_count", "label": "Trustpilot review count" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "trustpilot_url", "label": "Trustpilot page link", "info": "Optional. Opens your Trustpilot page in a new tab." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Low stock" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "low_stock_threshold", "label": "Show below this many left", "min": 0, "max": 20, "step": 1, "default": 10, "info": "Reads the chosen variant's real Shopify inventory count. Only shows for variants Shopify tracks and that stop selling at zero, so the number is always true. Set 0 to turn off." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "low_stock_text", "label": "Low stock line", "default": "Only [qty] left in this style" },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "stock_style",
      "label": "Low stock style",
      "options": [
        { "value": "pill", "label": "Yellow pill with blinking dot" },
        { "value": "line", "label": "Plain red line" }
      ],
      "default": "pill"
    },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Options" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "option_label", "label": "Style label", "default": "Style", "info": "Label for the product's other option. Leave empty to use the option's own name." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "model_label", "label": "Model label", "default": "Model" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "packs_label", "label": "Packs label (screen readers)", "default": "How many cases" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "savings_text", "label": "Savings line", "default": "[qty] cases saves you [amount] vs buying singly", "info": "[qty] and [amount] are filled in from the chosen pack." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "savings_next_text", "label": "Savings line on a single case", "default": "Choose [qty] cases to save [pct]% on each", "info": "[qty] and [pct] come from the next pack up." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Mix-and-match packs" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "mix_packs", "label": "Let each case in a pack have its own colour and phone", "default": true, "info": "Works with the store's pack discounts, which count any cases in the bag." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "mix_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Your [qty] cases", "info": "[qty] is the pack size." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "mix_hint", "label": "Hint", "default": "Pick a colour and phone for each case. Mix them however you like." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "mix_first_note", "label": "Note beside case 1", "default": "chosen above" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "mix_same", "label": "Match case 1 link", "default": "Same as case 1" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Buttons" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_label", "label": "Add to bag label", "default": "Add to bag" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_buy_now", "label": "Show Buy now", "default": true, "info": "Adds the chosen case and pack to the bag and goes straight to checkout." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "buy_label", "label": "Buy now label", "default": "Buy now" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sticky_cta", "label": "Sticky bar add label", "default": "Add to bag" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Ship-by date" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "dispatch_max", "label": "Latest dispatch, business days", "min": 0, "max": 10, "step": 1, "default": 3, "info": "The date shown is today plus this many business days (Monday to Friday). Set 0 to hide the line." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "ship_by_text", "label": "Ship-by line", "default": "Order today, ships by [date]" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "ship_by_fallback", "label": "Line before the date is worked out", "default": "Ships in 1-3 business days" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Accordions" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "details_label", "label": "Details label", "default": "Details" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "brand_label", "label": "Brand label", "default": "Brand" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "shipping_label", "label": "Shipping label", "default": "Shipping & returns" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "shipping_text", "label": "Shipping & returns", "default": "<p>Free shipping on every order. Orders leave us within 1 to 3 business days, and you have 30 days to return it.</p>", "info": "State only what is true for every order." }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "@app" },
    {
      "type": "tier",
      "name": "Pack tier",
      "limit": 4,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "number", "id": "qty", "label": "Cases", "default": 1 },
        { "type": "range", "id": "discount_pct", "label": "Discount per case", "min": 0, "max": 60, "step": 1, "unit": "%", "default": 0, "info": "Must match an automatic discount in Shopify admin > Discounts, or checkout will charge a different price than the page shows." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "name", "label": "Label", "default": "1 case" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "flag_label", "label": "Ribbon", "info": "Optional. Keep it true, for example Save 18% or Best value." },
        { "type": "select", "id": "accent", "label": "Box colour", "default": "red", "options": [ { "value": "red", "label": "Red stripes" }, { "value": "teal", "label": "Teal stripes" } ] },
        { "type": "checkbox", "id": "default_checked", "label": "Selected by default", "default": false }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "service",
      "name": "Service fact",
      "limit": 3,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "select", "id": "icon", "label": "Icon", "default": "truck", "options": [ { "value": "truck", "label": "Truck" }, { "value": "returns", "label": "Returns" }, { "value": "box", "label": "Box" } ] },
        { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "Text", "default": "Free shipping", "info": "Only facts true for every order." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "summary",
      "name": "Rating, price & pitch",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Shows under the product title: stars, rating and review count, then price, the variant's real compare-at price and saving, then a one-line pitch." },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "rating_source",
          "label": "Rating",
          "options": [
            { "value": "auto", "label": "Product reviews, else store rating" },
            { "value": "product", "label": "Product reviews only" },
            { "value": "store", "label": "Store rating only" }
          ],
          "default": "auto",
          "info": "Store rating is the \"External store rating\" and count set in this section."
        },
        { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_price", "label": "Show price, compare-at price and saving", "default": true },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "save_style",
          "label": "Saving",
          "options": [
            { "value": "amount", "label": "Amount, e.g. Save $10.00" },
            { "value": "percent", "label": "Percent, e.g. Save 17%" }
          ],
          "default": "amount"
        },
        { "type": "text", "id": "tagline", "label": "Pitch line", "info": "Keep it true for every product it shows on." },
        { "type": "product_list", "id": "pitch_products", "label": "Show the pitch only on", "limit": 50, "info": "Leave empty to show it on every product using this template." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "tagline_metafield", "label": "Pitch metafield (namespace.key)", "info": "Optional. A product's own text metafield replaces the pitch line, e.g. custom.pitch." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "google_rating",
      "name": "Google rating",
      "limit": 1,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Shows under the Add to bag button. Hidden until a rating is entered." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "rating", "label": "Google rating", "info": "Your current rating from your Google Business Profile, e.g. 4.4." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "review_count", "label": "Google review count", "info": "Optional." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "headline", "label": "Short quote", "info": "Optional. A word or phrase taken from a real Google review, e.g. Amazing." },
        { "type": "url", "id": "reviews_url", "label": "Google reviews link", "info": "Optional. Opens your Google reviews in a new tab." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "sales_note",
      "name": "Sales note",
      "limit": 2,
      "settings": [
        { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Shows a real sales number, e.g. \"18 sold this week\": the product's own count (Shopify admin → the product → \"Sold this week\" / \"Total sold\"), or the number typed here. Hidden when there is no number." },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "style",
          "label": "Style",
          "options": [
            { "value": "pill", "label": "Pill with blinking dot" },
            { "value": "rocket", "label": "Rocket line with pulsing number" }
          ],
          "default": "pill"
        },
        { "type": "number", "id": "count", "label": "Number", "info": "Shown on every product that has no count of its own. Use a real number, and word the text to match what it counts." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "metafield", "label": "Product count field (namespace.key)", "default": "custom.sold_recently", "info": "Each product's own number, set in Shopify admin on the product: custom.sold_recently is \"Sold this week\", custom.total_sold is \"Total sold\". It replaces the number above on that product." },
        { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "Text", "default": "[count] sold this week", "info": "[count] is the metafield value. Match the wording to what the number really counts, e.g. \"Hurry up! [count] items have been sold\" for an all-time total." },
        {
